# Frontend-scoped environment file (distinct from the repo-root .env.example,
# which stays backend-only per AGENTS.md §4). Not required by default: the
# dev server proxies /api to the backend (see vite.config.ts, OD-1's
# same-origin default), so no target URL needs to be injected client-side
# today. Kept here for a future non-proxied deployment target.
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api/v1
